 ## Invoice lifecycle
 
-`draft` → (`issue`) → `open` → (`pay`) → `paid`; `draft`/`open` → (`void`) → `void`.
+`draft` → (`issue`) → `open` → (`pay`) → `paid`; `draft`/`open`/`paid` → (`void`) → `void`.
+
+Credit notes (`POST`/`GET /invoices/:id/credit-notes`, numbered `CN-0001`, ...) can be issued against
+`open` or `paid` invoices, up to the invoice total minus earlier credit notes. Open invoices' credits
+reduce the outstanding report. Voiding a paid invoice issues a credit note for whatever is left.
